<view class="page">
  <coach-safe dark />
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="row">
      <view>
        <view class="title">Anti-Fraud Coach</view>
        <view class="subtitle">AI 校园反诈情景识别助手</view>
      </view>
      <image
        class="brand-logo"
        src="/assets/logo/afc-logo-v6-light.svg"
        bindtap="go"
        data-url="/pages/profile/index"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="hero-panel row">
      <view class="inline grow" style="gap: 14px">
        <coach-gauge score="{{report.safetyScore}}" size="{{64}}" />
        <view>
          <view class="muted">当前防诈安全指数</view>
          <view class="hero-name">
            {{report.safetyScore===null || !report?'完成训练后生成评估':report.safetyScore>=85?'防护状态良好':report.safetyScore>=70?'建议巩固薄弱项':'风险防范待提升'}}
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-stats">
        <view class="muted">已识别风险</view>
        <view class="value">{{report.riskCount || 0}} 次</view>
        <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 8px">训练完成度</view>
        <view class="value">{{report.completion || 0}}%</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="content" style="padding-top: 20px">
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">
      {{error}}
      <button class="link" bindtap="load">重试</button>
    </view>
    <view class="row" style="margin-bottom: 12px">
      <view class="section-title" style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0">立即检测可疑信息</view>
      <button class="link inline" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/detect/index">
        全部方式
        <ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="{{14}}" />
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{entries}}"
        wx:key="mode"
        class="action half"
        role="button"
        data-url="/pages/detect/index?mode={{item.mode}}"
        bindtap="go"
      >
        <view class="icon-box"><ui-icon name="{{item.icon}}" size="{{20}}" /></view>
        <view class="label">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.sub}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="grid" style="margin-top: 8px">
      <view class="card half row module" role="button" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/qa/index">
        <view class="grow">
          <view class="list-title">AI 问答</view>
          <view class="muted">实时防骗知识库</view>
        </view>
        <view class="icon-box"><ui-icon name="message-square" size="{{18}}" /></view>
      </view>
      <view
        class="card half row module"
        role="button"
        bindtap="go"
        data-url="/pages/training/index"
      >
        <view class="grow">
          <view class="list-title">情景训练</view>
          <view class="muted">已通关 {{report.completed || 0}}/6 关</view>
        </view>
        <view class="icon-box orange-box">
          <ui-icon name="target" tone="orange" size="{{18}}" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{reminder}}" class="card row" style="margin-top: 8px">
      <view class="icon-box red-box"><ui-icon name="triangle-alert" tone="red" /></view>
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="list-title">待强化情景：{{report.weaknesses[0].title || '虚假兼职'}}</view>
        <view class="muted">建议完成 1 次对抗演练消除盲区</view>
      </view>
      <button
        class="primary small"
        bindtap="go"
        data-url="/pages/training-detail/index?id={{report.weaknesses[0].id || '1'}}"
      >
        去训练
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="notice inline" style="align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 20px">
      <ui-icon name="shield-alert" tone="orange" size="{{16}}" />
      <text>
        涉及转账汇款、短信验证码、屏幕共享或脱离正规平台交易时，请先核实身份。紧急情况请立即联系辅导员或警方。
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <coach-nav active="home" />
</view>
